    "head_branch": "feature/carrying-in-the-crate",
    "head_commit_message": "refactor(sim): carrying as one crate pass (spec 39 step 8b5-xxix)\n\nFormationCarry.step is one call, `carry_step` (`carry/pass.rs`): bodies\nwhose bearers fled home come home out of their squads' members\n(\"fled_home\"), the borne follow their bearers or are dropped, bearers set\ntheir loads down, and the free units of the formations that tend their\ndowned pick bodies up (\"borne\"), each bearer's load stage, pace, tiring\nand dodge set in its sheet. A bearer's pace is a share of its\ndefinition's speed, which UnitWrites now hands the crate (`put_speed`).\nFormationCarry mirrors the states, the carrying and the loads, and its\nunit lists. `carry_pick_up` and its decoder are removed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011AyPi4nf5ZEpKGyHVzbrkd",
